<div class="adr-wrap adr-faq">
  <h1 class="adr-page-title"><i class="fa fa-circle-question"></i> FAQ — How to Play</h1>

  <div class="adr-faq-section">
    <h2>Getting Started</h2>
    <dl>
      <dt>How do I start playing?</dt>
      <dd>Go to <a href="/adr/character/create">Create Character</a> and fill in your character's details. Choose a race, class, element, alignment, and distribute your starting characteristics.</dd>
      <dt>What do characteristics do?</dt>
      <dd><strong>Might</strong> increases your physical attack. <strong>Dexterity</strong> improves speed and accuracy. <strong>Constitution</strong> boosts your max HP. <strong>Intelligence</strong> powers magic attacks. <strong>Wisdom</strong> increases MP and magic resistance. <strong>Charisma</strong> helps with trading and social interactions.</dd>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <div class="adr-faq-section">
    <h2>Battles</h2>
    <dl>
      <dt>How does PvE battle work?</dt>
      <dd>Visit the <a href="/adr/battle">Battle Arena</a>, choose a monster, and fight! The battle is automatically resolved over multiple rounds. You can choose a physical attack or magic attack each round.</dd>
      <dt>What is PvP?</dt>
      <dd>You can challenge other players to duels in the <a href="/adr/pvp">PvP Arena</a>. The challenged player must accept. Battles are resolved automatically.</dd>
      <dt>What is the battle limit?</dt>
      <dd>You have a limited number of battles per day. This resets daily. Winning heals limits; the temple can restore HP/MP.</dd>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <div class="adr-faq-section">
    <h2>Gold &amp; Economy</h2>
    <dl>
      <dt>How do I earn gold?</dt>
      <dd>Win battles, sell items in the market, or trade with other players.</dd>
      <dt>What is the Vault?</dt>
      <dd>The <a href="/adr/vault">Vault</a> is a bank where you can deposit gold for interest, take loans, and buy/sell stocks.</dd>
      <dt>How do shops work?</dt>
      <dd>You can open your own shop in the <a href="/adr/shops">Market</a> and list items from your inventory. A tax applies to listings.</dd>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <div class="adr-faq-section">
    <h2>Skills &amp; Crafting</h2>
    <dl>
      <dt>How do I improve my skills?</dt>
      <dd>Visit <a href="/adr/skills">Skills</a> and spend XP to train them. Skills include Mining, Forge, Enchantment, Trading, and Thievery.</dd>
      <dt>What can I forge?</dt>
      <dd>Mine ore at the <a href="/adr/forge">Forge</a>, then combine two materials to create weapons. Enchantment adds power boosts.</dd>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <div class="adr-faq-section">
    <h2>Prison &amp; Courthouse</h2>
    <dl>
      <dt>Why am I in jail?</dt>
      <dd>An administrator or community vote may have jailed you. Visit the <a href="/adr/cell">Cell</a> to see your sentence details or pay your fine.</dd>
      <dt>How does the Courthouse work?</dt>
      <dd>Community members can vote on jailed adventurers at the <a href="/adr/courthouse">Courthouse</a>. Enough release votes frees the prisoner early.</dd>
    </dl>
  </div>
</div>
